Package: weft
Title: Computed Values and Checks for Quarto and R Markdown Prose
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Robin", "Shannon", , "32329438+vorpalvorpal@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Lets a manuscript's prose carry computed values, and wording
    that depends on them, and adds deterministic checks for computational
    manuscripts. Every construct is markdown that 'knitr', 'Pandoc' and
    'Quarto' already accept.
